<title>USA: BASEBALL-SATURDAY'S LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-SATURDAY'S LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Major League</p>
<p>Baseball playoff games on Saturday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>National League Championship Series</p>
<p> ST LOUIS	   3   Atlanta	 2</p>
<p>(St Louis leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
<p>American League Championship Series</p>
<p>New York at BALTIMORE</p>
<p>(New York leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
